cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "decicontas.br: a Named Entity Recognition dataset of Brazilian audit-court decisions"
abstract: >-
  A public Named Entity Recognition dataset of 861 decisions issued by the
  Tribunal de Contas do Estado do Rio Grande do Norte (TCE/RN), annotated with
  four audit-relevant entity types (MULTA, OBRIGACAO, RESSARCIMENTO,
  RECOMENDACAO). The corpus is distributed in paired pre- and post-review
  versions, audited for label errors with confident learning, and validated by
  an independent three-annotator agreement study. Release bundles are provided
  in JSON, JSONL, CoNLL-2003 and BRAT formats, together with the evaluation and
  training pipelines used to produce the reported results.
